# REQUIRED ComfyUI custom nodes — name|git_url|pinned_sha
#
# Consumed by scripts/install_deps.sh:ensure_custom_nodes() on every ComfyUI
# start: any node missing from ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ is fetched at the pinned
# revision below. This file exists because a fresh box previously had NO way
# to obtain these (plugins/comfyui/ComfyUI/ is excluded from Interconnector
# sync, restore_app.sh deliberately never touches custom_nodes/, and
# install_deps.sh only installed requirements for nodes already on disk) —
# clients booted with facerestore_cf only and video generation died with
# "missing VHS_VideoCombine" (Observed: client box, 2026-08-04).
#
# The set below covers every non-core class_type that
# backend/services/comfyui_video_generator.py emits, plus face restoration:
#   VHS_VideoCombine            -> ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite
#   UnetLoaderGGUF              -> ComfyUI-GGUF
#   RIFE VFI                    -> ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation
#   ImageResizeKJ               -> ComfyUI-KJNodes
#   CogVideo* / DownloadAndLoad -> ComfyUI-CogVideoXWrapper
#   FaceRestoreCF*              -> facerestore_cf
#   ApplyPulidFlux / PulidFlux* -> ComfyUI-PuLID-Flux  (FLUX identity; not the
#                                 on-disk PuLID_ComfyUI pack, which is SDXL-only)
#
# Patches in custom_nodes.patches/<node>.patch are applied on top of the pinned
# revision by install_deps.sh (ComfyUI-PuLID-Flux: forward_orig accepts the newer
#   kwargs, and the identity data rides on the cloned patcher's transformer_options
#   instead of the module plus a __del__ that current ComfyUI fires before sampling;
#   attn_mask, accepted but ignored upstream, limits an identity to its face;
# kwargs ComfyUI >= 0.3.60 passes; upstream is unmaintained).
#
# Pins are the master box's tested revisions (captured 2026-08-04). To bump:
# update the node on master, test video generation, then update the SHA here.
# Skip auto-install entirely with GUAARDVARK_COMFYUI_AUTONODES=0 (offline-first).
ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite|https://github.com/Kosinkadink/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite|3234937ff5f3ca19068aaba5042771514de2429d
ComfyUI-GGUF|https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF|6ea2651e7df66d7585f6ffee804b20e92fb38b8a
ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation|https://github.com/Fannovel16/ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation|c66ffe51b597e85e18514bae373c3ee391438301
ComfyUI-KJNodes|https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes|01d9fa9c983273532cacdf9532c74a93c7dc86d2
ComfyUI-CogVideoXWrapper|https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-CogVideoXWrapper|fdb8abd2790b5459ddc7066c31861bb0b62e988b
facerestore_cf|https://github.com/mav-rik/facerestore_cf.git|ff4d7a5c102441d8f058dd6135797ffb57b6c6ad
ComfyUI-PuLID-Flux|https://github.com/balazik/ComfyUI-PuLID-Flux|a80912fc3435c358607bf4b43a58dbcbebdb09ff
